Fishlore represents advanced knowledge of fishing techniques, fish behavior,
and aquatic ecosystems. This expertise allows skilled anglers to identify
the best fishing spots, understand seasonal patterns, and select appropriate
bait for different species.

Those with high fishlore skill catch fish more frequently and are more
likely to land exceptional specimens. They can read water conditions, spot
signs of fish activity, and adjust their techniques based on weather and
time of day.

Fishlore knowledge is passed down from experienced fishermen to eager
apprentices. Some claim the best fishlore teachers can be found along
the coastal roads and near major waterways.

Class: General
Discipline: Advanced Adventuring

